  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of this programme is to build on progress and results achieved to date and ensure that political parties continue to ensure representation and voice within their structures and processes for people with disabilities, and that they are held accountable for adhering to pledges and commitments, and, as the programme enters the post-election period, that disability inclusion remains a key agenda.</narrative>
